# Baron Helmut Zemo: "Whenever you cast a black spell from your hand, Zemo connives." A colourless Ornithopter cast from Bot1's
# hand does not make it connive, nor does Bot2's black Entomb: no discard is asked and Zemo gets no +1/+1 counter. (The black spell
# cast from the hand that does is in the boast scenarios.) The boast's cost counts only the cards in Bot1's own graveyard: it holds
# Doomsday Excruciator (6) and Pox Plague (5), eleven symbols, and Bot2's graveyard holds Griselbrand (4), which brings them to
# fifteen only if it counted, so Zemo cannot boast.

